      "type": "fill_in_blank",
      "sentence": "Mandir ___ hai. (The temple is nearby.)",
      "correct": "paas",
      "acceptedVariants": ["paas"],
      "explanation": "'Mandir paas hai' = the temple is nearby. 'Paas' = near, close."
    },
    {
