      "prompt": "is it far",
      "direction": "from_english",
      "correct": "kya door hai",
      "acceptedVariants": ["kya door hai", "door hai"],
      "explanation": "'Kya door hai?' = is it far? 'Door' = far. The response will be 'haan, door hai' (yes, it's far) or 'nahin, paas hai' (no, it's nearby).",
